     11  7600							; screen he goes into the next room: east and west {3}
     12  7600							; through the openings, down and up by the stairs. {3}
     13  7600							;|; when pushed diagonally into it); the edges of the {2-2}
     14  7600							;|; screen stop him as the walls do. {2-2}
